<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_2_-_2_8_-_0_9_3_0_-_a_d_d_-_a_c_t_i_o_n_-_a_n_d_-_c_o_n_s_t_r_a_i_n_t_s.behavior_patch.depa-ontology apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "depa-ontology" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW1>
        系统 SHALL 支持为 Object Type 注册 Action（业务级可执行操作）。Action 由名称、参数 schema、以及一个将 Action 转换为一组 Mutation 的处理函数组成。Action 注册通过 `defineAction(runner, typeName, actionName, handler)` 完成。子类型 SHALL 继承父类型的 Action；子类型 SHALL 可以通过重新调用 `defineAction` 覆盖继承的 Action，并可在 handler 中通过 `callParentAction(ctx, actionName, params)` 调用父类型的原始 handler 以实现扩展（类似 super 调用）。执行时按最近祖先优先（MRO）解析 Action 定义。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW1>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-suite { name = "Action 定义与注册" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-c-e174a86f79 { name = "注册并执行 Action" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW2>
                已定义类型 `PurchaseOrder` 及属性 `status`(String)
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW2>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW3>
                调用 `defineAction(runner, &apos;PurchaseOrder&apos;, &apos;approve&apos;, handler)` 注册 Action；调用 `executeAction(runner, entityId, &apos;approve&apos;, params)` 执行
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW3>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW4>
                handler 被调用并返回一组 Mutation，系统按顺序执行这些 Mutation
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW4>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-c-6400900846 { name = "对不存在的 Action 执行报错" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW5>
                类型 `PurchaseOrder` 未注册 `reject` Action
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW5>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW6>
                调用 `executeAction(runner, entityId, &apos;reject&apos;, {})`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW6>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW7>
                系统抛出错误，提示 Action 不存在
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW7>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-c-eda8145d60 { name = "Action 继承" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW8>
                类型 `Asset` 注册了 Action `decommission`；`ITAsset` 继承自 `Asset`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW8>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW9>
                对 `ITAsset` 实例调用 `executeAction(runner, entityId, &apos;decommission&apos;, {})`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHW9>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWA>
                执行成功，使用从 `Asset` 继承的 Action 定义
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWA>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-c-5f2470b9c3 { name = "子类型覆盖并扩展父类型 Action" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWB>
                类型 `Asset` 注册了 Action `decommission`，其 handler 返回 `[{mutation: &apos;setStatus&apos;, params: {status: &apos;decommissioned&apos;}}]`；`ITAsset` 继承自 `Asset`，且 `ITAsset` 有额外属性 `ip_address`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWB>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWC>
                对 `ITAsset` 调用 `defineAction(runner, &apos;ITAsset&apos;, &apos;decommission&apos;, extendedHandler)` 覆盖该 Action；`extendedHandler` 内部调用 `callParentAction(ctx, &apos;decommission&apos;, params)` 获取父类 Mutation 列表，再追加 `[{mutation: &apos;clearIp&apos;, params: {}}]`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWC>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWD>
                对 `ITAsset` 实例执行 `decommission` 时，先执行父类的 `setStatus` Mutation，再执行子类的 `clearIp` Mutation
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWD>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-df9821a9a6-c-e47f6c8471 { name = "未覆盖时使用最近祖先的 Action" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWE>
                `Server` 继承自 `ITAsset` 继承自 `Asset`；`ITAsset` 覆盖了 `decommission` Action，`Server` 未覆盖
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWE>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWF>
                对 `Server` 实例执行 `decommission`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWF>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWG>
                使用 `ITAsset` 的覆盖版本（最近祖先优先）
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWG>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-badccce342" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-badccce342 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWH>
        系统 SHALL 支持定义 Mutation（原子数据变更操作）。Mutation 由名称和执行函数组成，通过 `defineMutation(runner, typeName, mutationName, executor)` 注册。Action handler 返回的 Mutation 列表 SHALL 在单次事务语义下按顺序执行。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWH>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-badccce342-suite { name = "Mutation 定义与原子执行" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-badccce342-c-5d9114521c { name = "定义并通过 Action 触发 Mutation" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWJ>
                类型 `PurchaseOrder` 定义了 Mutation `setStatus` 和 `addAuditLog`；Action `approve` 的 handler 返回 `[{mutation: &apos;setStatus&apos;, params: {status: &apos;approved&apos;}}, {mutation: &apos;addAuditLog&apos;, params: {action: &apos;approve&apos;}}]`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWJ>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWK>
                执行 `approve` Action
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWK>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWM>
                `setStatus` 和 `addAuditLog` 按顺序执行
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWM>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-badccce342-c-730e1183cb { name = "Mutation 执行失败时回滚" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWN>
                Action `approve` 触发两个 Mutation
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWN>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWP>
                第二个 Mutation 执行失败
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWP>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWQ>
                第一个 Mutation 的效果也被回滚，实体状态不变
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWQ>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-f488b680ad" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-f488b680ad (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWR>
        系统 SHALL 支持在 Action 执行前后注册拦截器。拦截器通过 `addInterceptor(runner, typeName, actionName, phase, handler)` 注册，`phase` 为 `&apos;before&apos;` 或 `&apos;after&apos;`。`before` 拦截器可阻止 Action 执行（抛出错误）；`after` 拦截器在 Mutation 全部完成后执行。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWR>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-f488b680ad-suite { name = "Action 拦截器（Interceptor）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-f488b680ad-c-ee809833b5 { name = "before 拦截器阻止 Action" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWS>
                类型 `PurchaseOrder` 的 `approve` Action 注册了 before 拦截器，校验 `status` 必须为 `pending`；某 PurchaseOrder 实例的 `status` 为 `approved`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWS>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWT>
                调用 `executeAction(runner, entityId, &apos;approve&apos;, {})`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWT>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWV>
                before 拦截器抛出错误，Action 不执行，实体状态不变
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWV>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-f488b680ad-c-2baf857c24 { name = "after 拦截器执行后置逻辑" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWW>
                `approve` Action 注册了 after 拦截器（如发送通知）
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWW>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWX>
                Action 及其 Mutation 全部成功执行
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWX>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWY>
                after 拦截器被调用
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWY>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWZ>
        系统 SHALL 支持定义条件约束：当实体满足某条件时，强制要求另一组属性/关系条件成立。通过 `defineConstraint(runner, typeName, constraintName, { when, then, message })` 注册。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHWZ>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63-suite { name = "条件约束（Conditional Constraint）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63-c-c533832235 { name = "条件约束校验通过" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX0>
                类型 `Employee` 定义了约束：当 `status=&apos;active&apos;` 时 `end_date` 必须为空；某 Employee 实例 `status=&apos;active&apos;`, `end_date` 未设置
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX0>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX1>
                调用 `validateConstraints(runner, entityId)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX1>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX2>
                校验通过
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX2>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63-c-620aa70545 { name = "条件约束校验失败" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX3>
                同上约束定义；某 Employee 实例 `status=&apos;active&apos;`, `end_date=&apos;2026-12-31&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX3>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX4>
                调用 `validateConstraints(runner, entityId)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX4>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX5>
                返回约束违反错误，包含约束名称和 message
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX5>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63-c-db3002bd56 { name = "写入时自动触发条件约束" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX6>
                同上约束定义
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX6>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX7>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, entityId, &apos;end_date&apos;, &apos;2026-12-31&apos;)` 且当前 `status=&apos;active&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX7>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX8>
                系统抛出约束违反错误，属性未被写入
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX8>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-667d22fd63-c-fb22f1f028 { name = "skipConstraints 跳过校验" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX9>
                同上约束定义
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHX9>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXA>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, entityId, &apos;end_date&apos;, &apos;2026-12-31&apos;, { skipConstraints: true })`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXA>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXB>
                属性被写入，不触发约束校验
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXB>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-55e50a999a" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-55e50a999a (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXC>
        系统 SHALL 支持定义跨实体约束：对某类型的所有实例或通过关系关联的实体集合施加聚合条件。通过 `defineConstraint(runner, typeName, constraintName, { scope: &apos;cross-entity&apos;, ... })` 注册。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXC>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-55e50a999a-suite { name = "跨实体约束（Cross-Entity Constraint）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-55e50a999a-c-e2cfbd5943 { name = "唯一性约束" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXD>
                类型 `Department` 定义了跨实体约束：通过 `heads` 关系关联的 Employee 最多 1 个；某 Department 已有 1 个 head
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXD>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXE>
                尝试 `linkEntities(runner, deptId, &apos;heads&apos;, newEmployeeId)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXE>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXF>
                系统抛出约束违反错误
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXF>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-55e50a999a-c-b418ff0cfe { name = "跨实体约束显式校验" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXG>
                同上约束定义
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXG>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXH>
                调用 `validateConstraints(runner, deptId)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXH>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXJ>
                系统检查该 Department 的 heads 关系数量并返回校验结果
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXJ>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXK>
        系统 SHALL 支持定义派生属性：其值由一个计算函数根据实体自身属性和/或关联实体属性自动计算。通过 `defineComputed(runner, typeName, attrName, computeFn)` 注册。派生属性 SHALL 在读取时按需计算（lazy），不持久化存储。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXK>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615-suite { name = "派生规则（Derived/Computed Property）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615-c-c553fcdcce { name = "定义并读取派生属性" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXM>
                类型 `PurchaseOrder` 定义了派生属性 `total`，计算逻辑为关联 LineItem 的 `unit_price × quantity` 之和
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXM>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXN>
                调用 `getEntityView(runner, poId)` 或 `getProperty(runner, poId, &apos;total&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXN>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXP>
                返回结果中包含 `total` 字段，值为实时计算结果
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXP>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615-c-9657bb3956 { name = "派生属性不可手动写入" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXQ>
                `total` 是 `PurchaseOrder` 的派生属性
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXQ>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXR>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, poId, &apos;total&apos;, 999)`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXR>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXS>
                系统抛出错误，提示不可写入派生属性
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXS>
              )>
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-90ea4dd615-c-bdec6aa528 { name = "派生属性用于约束" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXT>
                类型 `Asset` 定义了派生属性 `risk_score`；定义了约束：`risk_score &gt; 80` 时 `requires_review` 必须为 `true`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXT>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXV>
                约束校验时
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXV>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXW>
                系统先计算 `risk_score` 再评估约束条件
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXW>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-action-and-constraints-r-9aeb553907" } (
      <Requirement #add-action-and-constraints-r-9aeb553907 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXX>
        系统 SHALL 支持子类型继承父类型定义的所有约束。子类型 SHALL 可以定义额外约束，但 SHALL NOT 移除或放宽继承的约束。
        </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXX>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-action-and-constraints-r-9aeb553907-suite { name = "约束继承" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-action-and-constraints-r-9aeb553907-c-a0dbc0ca25 { name = "子类型继承父类型约束" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXY>
                `Asset` 定义了约束 `name_not_empty`；`ITAsset` 继承自 `Asset`
                </?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXY>
                <When ?01M1W0XR5QNAC0XZ19KZH0KHXZ>
                对 `ITAsset` 实例调用 `validateConstraints`
